# RentStack Privacy Policy

**Effective Date:** May 22, 2025  
**Last Updated:** May 22, 2025

---

## 1. Introduction

Welcome to RentStack, a property management application developed and operated by Bytemontan, a software company registered in Uganda. RentStack is designed to help landlords, property managers, and tenants manage rental properties, leases, payments, and related activities.

This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, share, and protect your personal information when you use the RentStack mobile application ("App") available on Google Play. By downloading and using the App, you agree to the practices described in this Policy.

---

## 2. Information We Collect

### 2.1 Information You Provide Directly

When you register and use RentStack, we may collect:

- Full name and contact details (email address, phone number)
- National ID or other identification details (where required for tenant verification)
- Property details including address, unit descriptions, and rental terms
- Lease agreement information and tenancy records
- Rent payment amounts and transaction histories
- Profile photos and documents you upload (e.g. lease agreements, receipts)
- Messages and notes entered within the App

### 2.2 Information Collected Automatically

When you use the App, we automatically collect certain technical information:

- Device identifiers (device model, operating system version)
- App usage data (features accessed, session duration)
- Log data (error reports, crash logs)
- IP address and approximate location (country/city level)

### 2.3 Payment Information

RentStack facilitates rent payments through integrated mobile money services (MTN Mobile Money and Airtel Money). When you initiate a payment:

- Your mobile money phone number is collected to process the transaction
- Transaction reference numbers and statuses are recorded
- We do not store full payment credentials or mobile money PINs
- Payment processing is handled by the respective mobile money service providers under their own privacy policies

---

## 3. How We Use Your Information

We use the information we collect to:

- Create and manage your RentStack account
- Enable landlords to manage their properties, units, tenants, and leases
- Enable tenants to view their lease details, payment history, and outstanding balances
- Process and record rent payment transactions
- Send you notifications about payments, lease renewals, and important updates
- Generate reports and receipts for landlords and tenants
- Provide offline functionality through local data synchronization on your device
- Improve the App's features, performance, and user experience
- Respond to your support requests and inquiries
- Comply with applicable Ugandan laws and regulations

---

## 4. Data Storage and Security

Your data is stored on secure servers hosted on DigitalOcean infrastructure. We implement industry-standard security measures including:

- Encrypted data transmission over HTTPS/TLS
- Access controls limiting who can view your personal data
- Regular security monitoring and updates

RentStack uses offline-first technology, meaning some of your data (such as property records and lease information) is stored locally on your device using SQLite to allow you to work without an internet connection. This local data is synchronized with our servers when connectivity is available.

While we take reasonable precautions to protect your information, no method of electronic storage or transmission is 100% secure. We encourage you to protect your account with a strong password and to log out when using shared devices.

---

## 5. How We Share Your Information

We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties. We may share your information only in the following circumstances:

### 5.1 Between App Users

Landlords can view information about their tenants (names, contact details, payment records) for tenants registered under their properties. Tenants can view their own lease and payment information but cannot access data of other tenants.

### 5.2 Service Providers

We work with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating the App, including:

- Mobile money payment processors (MTN Uganda, Airtel Uganda) — for processing rent payments
- Cloud infrastructure providers — for hosting and data storage

These providers are contractually required to protect your data and use it only for the purposes we specify.

### 5.3 Legal Requirements

We may disclose your information if required by Ugandan law, regulation, legal process, or a government authority, or when we believe disclosure is necessary to protect our rights, your safety, or the safety of others.

---

## 6. Data Retention

We retain your personal information for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide the App's services. If you delete your account, we will delete or anonymize your personal data within 90 days, except where we are required to retain it by law (for example, financial transaction records required under Ugandan tax law).

Data stored locally on your device remains there until you uninstall the App or clear the App's data.

---

## 7. Your Rights

Subject to applicable Ugandan law, you have the right to:

- Access the personal information we hold about you
- Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information
- Request deletion of your personal data (subject to legal retention requirements)
- Object to or restrict certain processing of your data
- Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent

To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at the details provided in Section 11 below. We will respond to your request within 30 days.

---

## 8. Children's Privacy

RentStack is not intended for use by persons under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 18. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us and we will promptly delete it.

---

## 9. Third-Party Services and Links

The App may contain links to or integrate with third-party services (such as MTN Mobile Money and Airtel Money). This Privacy Policy does not govern those third-party services. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any third-party services you use.

---

## 10. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in the App, our practices, or applicable law. When we make material changes, we will notify you through the App or by email before the changes take effect. The updated Policy will be available within the App and will indicate the new effective date.

Your continued use of RentStack after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised Privacy Policy.

